step Journeyman Mining
  tip Journeyman Mining raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction. Lodestone, Forever's camping item for Mining, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: Mining): a Rough Stone and a Copper Bar each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour.
  train Mining Journeyman
  learn 1230161

