step Smelt Bronze & Smelt Tin
  tip At 65 a Mining trainer teaches Smelt Bronze (2s; grey at 115) and Smelt Tin (50c; grey at 75): smelting at a forge raises Mining too, so smelt what you mine.
  learn 2659
  learn 3304

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 65-125
section Mining 65-125

step Incendicite & Tin: Wetlands (65-125)
  only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Wetlands
  tip Mine every Copper (1, green), Incendicite (65, orange), Tin (65, orange), Silver (from 75, rare) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 125. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: Smelt Copper (orange to 25, grey at 70), Smelt Tin (grey at 75), Smelt Bronze (grey at 115) give points too. Smelt Bronze takes a Copper Bar and a Tin Bar each: keep bars from the smelts before it. Zone level 20-30. Expect about 130 nodes for these 60 points. Smelt Silver (2s; orange to 100, grey at 125) is taught from 75: learn it if you pass a Mining trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own.
