  tip Expert Mining raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and no character level, and costs 50s: train it as soon as you reach 125. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction. Learn Smelt Iron (5s; orange to 130, grey at 140) on the same visit: smelting at a forge raises Mining too, so smelt what you mine.
