  tip Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, orange), Mithril (175, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 200. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: Smelt Gold (orange to 170, grey at 185) gives points too. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 40 nodes for these 25 points.
