# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 230-245
section Mining 230-245

step Mithril & Dark Iron: Searing Gorge (230-245)
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Mine every Gold (155, green), Mithril (175, green), Dark Iron (230, orange), Truesilver (230, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 245. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Dark Iron Ore smelts only at the Black Forge in Blackrock Depths (8 ore a bar). Zone level 43-50. Expect about 40 nodes for these 15 points.
