step Small Thorium: Felwood (245-275)
  zone Felwood
  tip Mine every Gold (155, green, rare), Mithril (175, green), Truesilver (230, orange), Small Thorium (245, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until Mining 275. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Quests here that need Mining: Salve via Mining (level 55, Arathandris Silversky; Alliance), Salve via Mining (level 55, Maybess Riverbreeze; Horde). Zone level 48-55. Expect about 50 nodes for these 30 points.
